  "body": "This release upgrades the bundled Curl library.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n\r\n### Bug Fix\r\n\r\n* Upgrade bundled Curl from `8.8.0` to `8.23.0` (latest version; see [Curl Releases](https://curl.se/docs/releases.html)), to fix, in some integrations, incorrect handling of file descriptors above 1024. #394\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-cpp/compare/v2.4.0...v2.4.1"
